Modifications: visual meshes converted from Collada to glTF and decimated to
about 15 % of their triangles (30 % for the hand, the finger whole); kinematics
unchanged. franka_description's full LICENSE, word for word:
crates/franka-description/LICENSE-franka_description.

The franka-vr-teleop package (tools/vr-teleop) carries the sources of
oculus_reader (https://github.com/rail-berkeley/oculus_reader), commit
1168953, under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its LICENSE, word for word:
tools/vr-teleop/franka_vr/quest_bridge/oculus_reader/LICENSE; the
modifications are listed in tools/vr-teleop/NOTICE. The headset APK that
reader installs embeds Meta's Oculus Mobile SDK under Meta's licence and is
not distributed here: it is downloaded from upstream and hash-checked.

No code from marcbone/libfranka-rs (EUPL-1.2) is used, copied or derived here;
its API shape informed the design of this crate.

